    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9965" root="خبن" body-key="x">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اخبن</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, TA) <i>hid,</i> or <i>concealed,
a thing in the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُبْنَة</span> [q. v.] <i>of his trousers,</i> (K,
TA,) <i>next the back:</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اثبن</span> signifies “ he hid, or
concealed, [a thing] in his <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُبْنَة</span>, next the belly. ”
(TA.) [See also what next follows.]

